        "imageUrl": "https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/749641027.jpg?k=b021f5427d9f40e6241de190d7c6d6775919b808ba88a4b3299a87b8a3573da6&o=",
        "imageUrl2": "https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max500/749641689.jpg?k=9e1e0d4a904a9dee921736223cb301785a2b787498f73842c8d5a1cf89fd6fd4&o=",
        "description_fr": "Niché à côté de la pinède dans la partie calme de la station balnéaire de Palanga, le Gradiali Wellness and SPA se trouve à 500 mètres de la plage de sable de la mer Baltique. L’accès au spa et au sauna est inclus. Un rabais pour les procédures médicales est proposé. Vous pourrez profiter gratuitement de la salle de sport.\nDécorées dans des tons beige et marron, toutes les chambres disposent d’une télévision à écran plat, d’un réfrigérateur et d’un balcon. Les salles de bains privatives sont pourvues du chauffage au sol, d’une douche, de peignoirs et d’articles de toilette gratuits. Certaines chambres donnent sur la forêt, d’autres sur la cour tandis que les celles du dernier étage bénéficient d’une vue sur la mer.",
        "description_en": "Nestled next to the pine forest in the quiet part of Palanga resort, Gradiali Wellness and SPA Hotel is 500 metres from the sandy Baltic Sea beach. Access to spa and sauna is included. A discount for medical procedures is offered. The fitness centre is free of charge.\nDecorated with shades of cream and brown colours, all rooms come with a flat-screen TV, a refrigerator and a balcony. Private bathrooms are equipped with heated floors, a shower, bathrobes and free toiletries. Some rooms overlook the forest, others the courtyard and the top floor rooms offer a view of the sea.\nGuests at Gradiali Wellness and SPA Hotel are welcome to enjoy a variety of massages, herbal bubble baths, underwater massages and other procedures at an extra fee.",
        "description_es": "Nestled next to the pine forest in the quiet part of Palanga resort, Gradiali Wellness and SPA Hotel is 500 metres from the sandy Baltic Sea beach. Access to spa and sauna is included. A discount for medical procedures is offered. The fitness centre is free of charge.\nDecorated with shades of cream and brown colours, all rooms come with a flat-screen TV, a refrigerator and a balcony. Private bathrooms are equipped with heated floors, a shower, bathrobes and free toiletries. Some rooms overlook the forest, others the courtyard and the top floor rooms offer a view of the sea.\nGuests at Gradiali Wellness and SPA Hotel are welcome to enjoy a variety of massages, herbal bubble baths, underwater massages and other procedures at an extra fee.",
        "description_pt": "Nestled next to the pine forest in the quiet part of Palanga resort, Gradiali Wellness and SPA Hotel is 500 metres from the sandy Baltic Sea beach. Access to spa and sauna is included. A discount for medical procedures is offered. The fitness centre is free of charge.\nDecorated with shades of cream and brown colours, all rooms come with a flat-screen TV, a refrigerator and a balcony. Private bathrooms are equipped with heated floors, a shower, bathrobes and free toiletries. Some rooms overlook the forest, others the courtyard and the top floor rooms offer a view of the sea.\nGuests at Gradiali Wellness and SPA Hotel are welcome to enjoy a variety of massages, herbal bubble baths, underwater massages and other procedures at an extra fee.",
        "description_it": "Situato vicino alla pineta, in una zona tranquilla della località di Palanga, il Gradiali Wellness and SPA Hotel sorge a 500 metri dalla spiaggia sabbiosa bagnata dal Mar Baltico. La tariffa include l'ingresso al centro benessere e alla sauna. Come ospiti della struttura avrete diritto a uno sconto sui trattamenti medici. Il centro fitness è accessibile gratuitamente.\nDecorate in tonalità crema e marrone, le camere dispongono di TV a schermo piatto, frigorifero e balcone. I bagni privati sono dotati di riscaldamento a pavimento, doccia, accappatoi e set di cortesia. Alcune unità si affacciano sulla foresta, altre sul cortile; le sistemazioni all'ultimo piano regalano la vista sul mare.",
